### Get recent delay observations for a trip
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/trips/1/delays?limit=10
Accept: application/json


### Calculate Trip reliability
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/trips/1/reliability
Accept: application/json

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/nta/realtime/trip-updates/publish?feedVersionId=1&limit=3

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/dashboard/summary?feedVersionId=1&hours=24

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/routes/45/stops/delays?hours=24&limit=10